pine-runner runs as a separate, optional sidecar process on the self-hosted
checker VM. It is invoked by scripts/check.ts only to evaluate Pine Script
alert conditions and is not required for core price/indicator alerts.

pine-runner/ is NOT bundled into, nor distributed with, the MIT-licensed
npm package @vibetechnologies/mkt-alerts.

The rest of the mkt-alerts project (repo root, scripts/, the CLI) remains
MIT licensed; only this pine-runner/ subdirectory is AGPL-3.0.
